4. Linux Mint (stick image, written by the Windows app)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The USB stick's boot partition is an unmodified Linux Mint ISO
(linuxmint-22.3-xfce-64bit.iso, sha256 pinned in branding.json). Linux Mint is
distributed under its own terms; see linuxmint.com/about.php. Mint ships its own
third-party notice file inside the ISO.

